; Import library definition for the R3 corpora (`seh_corpus.c`, `teb_corpus.c`): only the KERNEL32 exports the
; corpus calls. Built with `llvm-dlltool -m i386:x86-64 -d kernel32.def -l kernel32.lib`.
LIBRARY KERNEL32.dll
EXPORTS
RaiseException
RtlUnwindEx
RtlCaptureContext
RtlLookupFunctionEntry
RtlVirtualUnwind
TlsAlloc
TlsFree
TlsGetValue
TlsSetValue
FlsAlloc
FlsFree
FlsGetValue
FlsSetValue
GetLastError
SetLastError
GetCurrentThreadId
CreateThread
ExitThread
ResumeThread
TerminateThread
GetExitCodeThread
WaitForSingleObject
CloseHandle
Sleep
CreateEventW
SetEvent
InitializeCriticalSection
EnterCriticalSection
LeaveCriticalSection
DeleteCriticalSection
